      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "因为房间很多，她很累，所以她想到了一个办法。",
      "traditional": "因為房間很多，她很累，所以她想到了一個辦法。",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi fáng jiān hěn duō tā hěn lèi suǒ yǐ tā xiǎng dào le yí ge bàn fǎ",
      "english": "One day Little Ming's mom was cleaning the house."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "她在家里的小黑板上写了一句话：打扫房间，人人有责。",
      "traditional": "她在家裡的小黑板上寫了一句話：打掃房間，人人有責。",
      "pinyin": "tā zài jiā lǐ de xiǎo hēi bǎn shang xiě le yí jù huà dǎ sǎo fáng jiān rén rén yǒu zé",
      "english": "Because there were so many rooms, she got very tired and thought up a scheme."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "她想让大家一起来打扫房间。",
      "traditional": "她想讓大家一起來打掃房間。",
      "pinyin": "tā xiǎng ràng dà jiā yì qǐ lái dǎ sǎo fáng jiān",
      "english": "On the little blackboard in the house, she wrote the words: “Cleaning the house is everyone's responsibility”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "She wanted to make everyone clean the house together."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "小明放学回来，看到小黑板上的字，",
      "traditional": "小明放學回來，看到小黑板上的字，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng fàng xué huí lái kàn dào xiǎo hēi bǎn shang de zì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "想了一下，在黑板上加了一横，",
      "traditional": "想了一下，在黑板上加了一橫，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎng le yí xià zài hēi bǎn shang jiā le yì héng",
      "english": "Little Ming came home from school and noticed the words on the little blackboard."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "变成了：打扫房间，大人有责。",
      "traditional": "變成了：打掃房間，大人有責。",
      "pinyin": "biàn chéng le dǎ sǎo fáng jiān dà ren yǒu zé",
      "english": "He thought for a while and then added a horizontal line to the blackboard, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "这样他就不用打扫房间了，因为打扫房间变成了大人的事。",
      "traditional": "這樣他就不用打掃房間了，因為打掃房間變成了大人的事。",
      "pinyin": "zhè yàng tā jiù bú yòng dǎ sǎo fáng jiān le yīn wèi dǎ sǎo fáng jiān biàn chéng le dà ren de shì",
      "english": ".. turning it into: “Cleaning the house is the grown-ups' responsibility”"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
