    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Difference of One Character",
      "",
      "One day Little Ming's mom was cleaning the house.",
      "Because there were so many rooms, she got very tired and thought up a scheme.",
      "On the little blackboard in the house, she wrote the words: “Cleaning the house is everyone's responsibility”",
      "She wanted to make everyone clean the house together.",
      "",
      "Little Ming came home from school and noticed the words on the little blackboard.",
      "He thought for a while and then added a horizontal line to the blackboard, ..",
      ".. turning it into: “Cleaning the house is the grown-ups' responsibility”",
      "This way he didn't have to help out cleaning, because cleaning the house became the adults' job.",
      "",
      "Little Ming's dad came home from work and also noticed the little blackboard saying “Cleaning the house is the grown-ups' responsibility”",
      "He thought for a bit, then added another horizontal line to the blackboard, changing it into: “Cleaning the house is the wife's responsibility”",
      "",
      "When Little Ming's mother came out and saw the letters on the little blackboard, she was both angry and amused."
    ]
  }
